===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|stone fruit}}

# Any [[fruit]] with a [[soft]] [[fleshy]] [[exterior]] surrounding a hard [[pit]] or [[stone]] containing the [[seed]].
#: {{syn|en|drupe}}
#: {{hyponyms|en|almond|apricot|cherry|nectarine|peach|plum|date|mango|olive|coffee|pistachio|jujube}}
# Any plant in the [[genus]] {{taxfmt|Prunus|genus}}.

====Usage notes====
* References to "the stone fruits", or to stone fruits as a group are usually references to members of the genus {{taxfmt|Prunus|genus}} (plums, cherries, and related plants).  Similarly constructed fruits from other groups of plants, such as [[olive]]s, are described with the more general term [[drupe]].

